{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ac6e24d30d5e998905dc58ecc42a04f5d01e97eba82d3aa975e6cdc11b2650b2", "ja": "（ユニットのライブとPV撮影は無事終了。\n今日は久しぶりに、のり子と息抜きにやってきた）", "zh": "（组合的演唱会和PV拍摄都顺利结束了。\n今天难得和纪子一起来放松一下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "027a51f91a157b7ed3c5d307c4eafd8af4ee4b7d12885be87052e54021a69141", "ja": "あ～、それにしても楽しかったな～。\n90年代！", "zh": "啊～，不过话说回来真开心啊～。\n90年代！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f7c566c22d854008bcdf8403f8f9f3116ffbaee3f7e8b596c81de2b0438a86ba", "ja": "（さっきから、のり子の話は尽きない。中でも\nのり子の興味が向けられているのは、当然……）", "zh": "（从刚才开始，法子的话题就没停过。其中，她感兴趣的当然是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "819f0f457c00ed11e95eee5fb10f59a562c873e508c69d6031088ea7a9986435", "ja": "分厚いプロレス雑誌もたくさんあったし、\n極めつけは、テレビでやってたあの試合だよね！", "zh": "厚厚的职业摔跤杂志也有很多，最绝的是电视上播的那场比赛，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "cfd7d066bdc792fc28fd72d0330d76fd3aac34910c6c3c24cc4f5f9009715cd6", "ja": "あの試合を見られるなんて、ほんと感動したよ！\nけど、どうやったの？　{$P$}！", "zh": "能看到那场比赛，真是太让我感动了！\n不过，你是怎么做到的？{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c8ee92be101bc69dde19e8f127bfcb684d5a0fd451da723bd1da256d240b76b8", "ja": "そ、そうだな。ええと……。", "zh": "嗯、是啊。那个……褪免费人成?", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b9c7503eb9f7b76b798faed3775b7b64f641bbe1ada8027deb1f86b95de5ed1a", "ja": "（のり子はタイムスリップした事を、俺が仕掛けた\nドッキリだと思っている。けど、本当は……）", "zh": "（法子以为自己穿越时空是我策划的恶作剧。不过，真相其实是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "a8cde464a915f247469433c184fe07a5205c220c6d290c28d51cbda4f7737715", "ja": "あっ、わかった！　アタシたちのために、\n詳しい人にお願いして、映像借りたんでしょ！", "zh": "啊，我明白了！你是为了我们，拜托懂行的人借来了影像，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "9ff06d2884cf7af8974906b40142fc3da561b9cc271bd4eb27f2b590abc40153", "ja": "ほんと、さすが{$P$}だよね！\nアタシたちのために、そこまでしてくれるなんてさ♪", "zh": "真是，不愧是{$P$}！居然为了我们做到这种地步♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "850ee9dcb0b85d411e92309aae3392af34545ad9c28d60dabb429ee527a1c867", "ja": "（タイムスリップは現実で、俺は何もしてないんだけど\n……本当の事を言うと、また怖がらせちゃうしな）", "zh": "（穿越时空是真实发生的，我什么也没做……可要是说出真相，她肯定又会被吓到。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "216dc746163f6251ae36d19c93b12bab4e15827b07f1db61f2eed10117972666", "ja": "でも、意外だった！　90年代って、思ってたより、\n今とそんなに変わらなかったっていうか……。", "zh": "不过，真让人意外！90年代比我想象的，更接近现在，或者说……没那么不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "e25ee11dae695e9b91e1efb03a5c6c143ecb47c04e23c530749eecce10bfaaea", "ja": "変わらないのに、すごく刺激されたっていうか。\nなんか勇気をもらえた気がする！", "zh": "明明没什么变化，却又受到了很大的启发。\n总觉得从中获得了勇气呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2ebb2525e381548e4f84d83acdb524d1e77b19dabea1c3bb8904d054cf81cf42", "ja": "勇気？", "zh": "勇气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "a0a2a449ed1d77ce3701cf1af9ed7a71bd100d00ec5464666cf4bcceae693d16", "ja": "うん！　だって90年代で見てもプロレスは\n熱かったし、ディスコも、すっごく楽しかった！", "zh": "嗯！因为就算从90年代来看，职业摔角也很火热，迪斯科也特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "c866b52f8b27352069007b27523e6e0ffea05454c18fc420b56200658aa942f4", "ja": "アタシの「好き」は、どの時代にいっても\n変わらないんだろうな～って。そう思えたんだ！", "zh": "我觉得，不管到了哪个时代，我的“喜欢”应该都不会改变吧～。我就是这么想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1015_p", "source_sha256": "303fb0c7cc95953eb2519f62c58b6f4a1b828db26ee4b6c410acff0e21aca95d", "ja": "なるほど……。それならどの時代でも、のり子が\nアイドルデビューするのも、きっと変わらないな。", "zh": "原来如此……。这样的话，不管在哪个时代，阿诺作为偶像出道这件事肯定也不会改变吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "c83af2835580d48e8b1c7220ba95246944d1d5c49e3fdd1d0cb44aaafd27da78", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうかな。\nそうだといいんだけど……えへへ♪", "zh": "诶！？是、是这样吗？\n要真是那样就好了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "b499fc84ac8add40f02f64c8c235ece5c5a842a51d35015c7ac0ca16cdccf484", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。時代が変わっても、\nアタシのこと、プロデュースしてくれる？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。就算时代变了，\n你也会继续制作我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bf05267a1a76209548bfc3870e628d729809c18a7f925dff6cb579c1079aca82", "ja": "もちろん！　たとえ江戸時代に\nタイムスリップしたって、プロデュースするよ。", "zh": "当然！就算穿越到了江户时代，我也会制作你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "50315e792311aeb1c95495573bd6ba861267fbbe5b74e150447ca80cc7428c95", "ja": "ありがと！　じゃあアタシも、安心して江戸時代で\nアイドルやるよ！　何するのかはわかんないけど……。", "zh": "谢谢！那我也可以放心地在江户时代\n当偶像啦！虽然我完全不知道该干些什么就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0163_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b2af161026afcd94fa1d233130686a794dad69c969c5862a745b71633af60e53", "ja": "（タイムスリップは少しだけ困るけど……けど、たとえ\n時代が変わっても、のり子の魅力は皆に届くはずだ！）", "zh": "（虽然穿越时空是有点伤脑筋……不过，就算时代改变了，法子的魅力也一定能传达给大家！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
